      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787594019303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j8eUQ8XMQzPOmFY6vL3pu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -787.3422397914358,
      "y": 256.4784073348052,
      "width": 629.91943359375,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ar",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1921536939,
      "version": 500,
      "versionNonce": 1632116203,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787594019303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Lock Management\n    * Acquire distributed lock\n    * Release distributed lock\n    * Renew lock lease.\n    * Check lock ownership.\n    * Check lock status.\n    * Force unlock (admin operation). in cases of deadlock\n    * Support lock expiration. TTL for locks to recover deadlock\n\n2. Lock Types\n    * Exclusive Lock\n    * Shared Lock\n    * Reentrant Lock\n    * Read Lock\n    * Write Lock\n    * Fair Lock\n    * Lease-based Lock\n\n3. Lifecycle\n    * Automatice Lock expiration\n    * heartbeat-based lock renewal\n    * Dead lock recovery\n    * Lock ownership validation\n    * Lock timeout handling",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Lock Management\n    * Acquire distributed lock\n    * Release distributed lock\n    * Renew lock lease.\n    * Check lock ownership.\n    * Check lock status.\n    * Force unlock (admin operation). in cases of deadlock\n    * Support lock expiration. TTL for locks to recover deadlock\n\n2. Lock Types\n    * Exclusive Lock\n    * Shared Lock\n    * Reentrant Lock\n    * Read Lock\n    * Write Lock\n    * Fair Lock\n    * Lease-based Lock\n\n3. Lifecycle\n    * Automatice Lock expiration\n    * heartbeat-based lock renewal\n    * Dead lock recovery\n    * Lock ownership validation\n    * Lock timeout handling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DjVW__aTdH9u_qQZRjbsf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -330.85242361187875,
      "y": 476.464705627896,
      "width": 301.19970703125,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 788687787,
      "version": 329,
      "versionNonce": 436414603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787594019303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Monitoring\n    * Active Lock Monitoring\n    * Lock wait monitoring\n    * Lock contention reporting\n    * Expired Lock tracking\n    * Failed acquistion tracking",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Monitoring\n    * Active Lock Monitoring\n    * Lock wait monitoring\n    * Lock contention reporting\n    * Expired Lock tracking\n    * Failed acquistion tracking",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3DNHHRTpAz6bDYepnZnjs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -296.4079791674342,
      "y": 665.3535945167848,
      "width": 270.07977294921875,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1895885221,
      "version": 249,
      "versionNonce": 675536683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787594019303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. High Availability\n    * Multi-node lock service\n    * Automatic failover\n    * Leader election\n    * Data replication\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. High Availability\n    * Multi-node lock service\n    * Automatic failover\n    * Leader election\n    * Data replication\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
