      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Exclusive Lock :- (Mutex) only one thread at atime can access a shared resource\n\n2. Shared Lock :- (read lock) allows multiple threads to access a shared resource at the\n    exact same time as long as they are only reading the data and not modifying it\n\n3. Reentrant Lock :- (Recurise Lock): an excluisve lock that allows the exact same thread\n    to acquire it multiple times without getting stuck waiting for itself\n    * The lock remembers which thread currently owns it and maintain acounter the thread\n    needs to unlock it as many times as it was locked. lock is only free when counter is 0\n\n4. Fair Lock :- Guarantees threads acquire the lock in the exact order they requested it\n    strictly FIFO like a queue, prevents thread strarvation\n\n5. Lease based lock :- comes wiith build in TTL most common lock in disributed systems. if\n    the process needs to extend the time it can send a heartbeat signal to extend the lease\n    before it expires.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Exclusive Lock :- (Mutex) only one thread at atime can access a shared resource\n\n2. Shared Lock :- (read lock) allows multiple threads to access a shared resource at the\n    exact same time as long as they are only reading the data and not modifying it\n\n3. Reentrant Lock :- (Recurise Lock): an excluisve lock that allows the exact same thread\n    to acquire it multiple times without getting stuck waiting for itself\n    * The lock remembers which thread currently owns it and maintain acounter the thread\n    needs to unlock it as many times as it was locked. lock is only free when counter is 0\n\n4. Fair Lock :- Guarantees threads acquire the lock in the exact order they requested it\n    strictly FIFO like a queue, prevents thread strarvation\n\n5. Lease based lock :- comes wiith build in TTL most common lock in disributed systems. if\n    the process needs to extend the time it can send a heartbeat signal to extend the lease\n    before it expires.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
