      "updated": 1788193977005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Renew the lock\n\nPOST /api/v1/locks/{lockKey}/renew\nRequest Bdoy : - \n\n{\n  \"lockId\": \"8f2c7c3e-5d91-4b2c-a9d2-123456789abc\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"payment-service-instance-42\",\n  \"leaseDurationMs\": 30000\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Renew the lock\n\nPOST /api/v1/locks/{lockKey}/renew\nRequest Bdoy : - \n\n{\n  \"lockId\": \"8f2c7c3e-5d91-4b2c-a9d2-123456789abc\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"payment-service-instance-42\",\n  \"leaseDurationMs\": 30000\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
